    2 Cl    -11.009   -6.139   -0.148  -11.109   -6.057   -0.166  -11.007   -6.313   -0.320   -0.172
    3 Cl    -11.009   -6.139   -0.148  -11.109   -6.057   -0.166  -11.007   -6.313   -0.320   -0.172
